<title>USA: Dart Group Q4 sales $185.56 mln.</title>
<headline>Dart Group Q4 sales $185.56 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LANDOVER, Md. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dart Group Corp said Tuesday its sales for the 12 months and fourth quarter ended January 31, 1997 were $663.831 million and $185.56 million, respectively.</p>
<p>Comparable store sales dropped 1.9 percent and 5.7 percent for the 12 months and quarter over the same periods a year ago, it said.</p>
<p>Sales of three of its companies, Crown Books, Trak Auto and Total Beverage rose $8.67 million, or 1.3 percent, for the 12 months to January 31, 1997 compared to the same period a year ago, it said.</p>
